      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A warning about an error that prevents avatar animation entirely reminds me of Charlie and the chocolate factory. Willy Wonka softly warning people to stop being unsafe. \n\nOther than humor purposes it might be wise to limit hard errors that block compilation to things that negatively effect other users. I'm assuming this t-pose is not contagious.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
