  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-02-09T16:42:22.399Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, if you put in by mistake the same parameter into the VRChat Avatar Parameters twice, it gets your character stuck in a T-pose (also does this when using the 3.0 Avatar Emulator)\n\nThe Unity console throws an error if you playtest in Unity with the 3.0 Avatar Emulator, but I don't think generally speaking people will figure this out.\n\nSolution might be posting a warning in the SDK summary, alongside other possible errors.",
